SUMMARY:Fire Ritual
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nGather round the fire and we hold space for this a
 ncient elemental practice of protection and cleansing.\nFire has long been
  associated with healing and protection\, its flames believed to possess t
 he power to cleanse\, ward off evil\, and bring about transformation.\n\nT
 his evening we will gather around our own sacred fire. In ancient times fi
 re was not just a practical necessity but a spiritual force that connected
  the people to the divine.\nThats what we are cultivating this evening.\n\
 n**Together we will:**\nHonor the element of fire\nSet energetic protectio
 ns\nLead you through a guided meditation\nConnect with plant spirits for s
 acred release\nDiscuss the importance of this time of year\nAnd more\n\n**
 About your guides**\n***Jenn (She/Her)*** is an intuitive healer trained Y
 oga Teacher 9+ years\, Reiki Master\, Astrologer and Spiritual Coach. She 
 combines her knowledge of the body from 13 years working in physical thera
 py with all spiritual tools that have contributed to her own healing & spi
 ritual journey to help guide others.\n***Vi (They/Them)*** is a practicing
  Witch & Psychic who is a trained Yoga Teacher\, Reiki Master\, and Tarot 
 Reader. They combine their passions of astrology\, divination\, dance\, an
 d creative expression to help others listen to their intuition.\n***Alessa
 ndra Mary (she/her)*** is a ceremonialist\, Akashic priestess\, mystic\, a
 uthor\, and sacred storyteller devoted to the path of remembrance. Through
  sacred gatherings and oracular transmissions\, she weaves soulful experie
 nces that invite you into deeper connection with synchronicity\, authentic
 ity\, and the unseen magic woven through everyday life. She stewards the l
 and we will be gathering on.\n\n**Donation suggestion:** $25-$35\n\n**PLEA
 SE NOTE:** Pre-registration is required for this event to honor the capaci
 ty of the space. If you would like to skip the fees\, you can Venmo us you
 r donation [here](https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary "https://venmo.com
 /u/iamalessandramary")
