SUMMARY:11/1 Manifestation Portal
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nHave you ever wondered what is the difference betw
 een manifesting and magnatism?\nWhat about how shadow work plays a role in
  the alchemy of it all?\n\nOn 11/1 we will be gathering at the Soul Sanctu
 ary for a Samhain manifestion portal ritual. Join us as we explore the ric
 h history of Samhain. As well as\, guide the group through the full manife
 station process. So we all can embody that which we are calling forth in o
 ur life.\n\n**About your guides**\n***Jenn (She/Her)*** is an intuitive he
 aler trained Yoga Teacher 9+ years\, Reiki Master\, Astrologer and Spiritu
 al Coach. She combines her knowledge of the body from 13 years working in 
 physical therapy with all spiritual tools that have contributed to her own
  healing & spiritual journey to help guide others.\n***Vi (They/Them)*** i
 s a practicing Witch & Psychic who is a trained Yoga Teacher\, Reiki Maste
 r\, and Tarot Reader. They combine their passions of astrology\, divinatio
 n\, dance\, and creative expression to help others listen to their intuiti
 on.\n***Alessandra Mary (she/her)*** is a ceremonialist\, Akashic priestes
 s\, mystic\, author\, and sacred storyteller devoted to the path of rememb
 rance. Through sacred gatherings and oracular transmissions\, she weaves s
 oulful experiences that invite you into deeper connection with synchronici
 ty\, authenticity\, and the unseen magic woven through everyday life. She 
 stewards the land we will be gathering on.\n\nDonation suggestion: $25-$35
 \n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** Pre-registration is required for this event to honor 
 the capacity of the space. If you would like to skip the fees\, you can Ve
 nmo us your donation [here](https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary "https:/
 /venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary")
