SUMMARY:New Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJoin us for a gathering to set new intentions and 
 connect with the energy of the new moon.\nMeet the New Moon in ceremony th
 rough astrology\, Akashic soul journeying\, ritual & embodied intention.\n
 Approaching the threshold of a new lunar cycle with intentionality is a po
 werful choice that becomes even more amplified when done in community.\n\n
 The New Moon offers a monthly portal to pause\, listen inward\, and consci
 ously seed what you desire to cultivate in the cycle ahead. Gathering in c
 eremony creates the space to step outside the momentum of everyday life an
 d meet that threshold with presence\, allowing your intentions to be witne
 ssed\, embodied\, and amplified within the collective.\n\nEach New Moon al
 so carries the unique energetic signature of the zodiac sign it moves thro
 ugh\, offering different themes and invitations for your growth. By workin
 g intentionally with the astrology of each lunation\, you can align your i
 ntentions with the energies already available to you and receive deeper cl
 arity around what is ready to begin.\n\nEach month\, we gather at the Soul
  Sanctuary beneath the dark moon sky for an evening of astrology\, soul jo
 urneying\, ritual\, and embodied intention.\n\n**This month with the Scorp
 io New Moon\, we invite you beneath the surface\, into the places where tr
 uth\, power\, intimacy\, and transformation reside.**\n\n**Together\, we
 ’ll work with Scorpio’s alchemical medicine to release what has run it
 s course\, reclaim energy or power we’ve given away\, and plant intentio
 ns rooted in the deeper truth of who we are becoming.**\n\n**What to Expec
 t**\n\n* Guided drop-in meditation\n* Astrological teaching + transmission
 \n* Guided Akashic soul journey\n* Reflection + intention setting\n* Cerem
 onial fire offerings\n* Closing embodiment + integration\n* Sacred space f
 or connection and community\n\nNo prior experience with astrology\, medita
 tion\, or ceremonial practice is necessary. Simply come as you are.\n\n**A
 bout Your Facilitators**\nAlessandra Mary is a trained priestess\, ceremon
 ialist\, and Akashic guide devoted to creating spaces where the sacred bec
 omes something you can experience\, embody\, and weave into everyday life.
 \n\nJenn is a witch of the cosmos and astrologer who brings the language o
 f the stars down to earth\, illuminating the energetic patterns and possib
 ilities available within each lunar cycle.\n\nTogether\, Alessandra and Je
 nn weave the mystical and the embodied\, the cosmic and the ceremonial\, c
 reating a space where you can not only understand the energy of the New Mo
 on\, but more importantly\, experience it.\n\n**What to Bring**\nOur cerem
 ony will primarily take place outside on the grass around the fire\, with 
 a large covered porch available as our rain plan. Please dress with the ev
 ening weather in mind.\n\n**Be sure to bring:**\n\n* Water bottle\n* Journ
 al + pen\n* Comfortable clothing and layers appropriate for the weather\n*
  Any sacred objects\, crystals\, talismans\, or other items you would like
  to place on our collective altar and charge during the ceremony\n\nLawn b
 lankets and meditation cushions will be provided\, though you are very wel
 come to bring your own blanket\, cushion\, or camping chair if you’d pre
 fer.\n\nCome ready to slow down\, listen deeply\, sit beneath the dark moo
 n\, and lean into what is waiting to begin.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: Pre-registra
 tion is required for this event to honor the capacity of the space.** If y
 ou would like to skip the eventbrite fees\, you can Venmo us $30 [here](ht
 tps://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary "https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary
 "):
